{
  "project": {
    "name": "Drainage Plant Pot & Saucer",
    "slug": "plant-pot",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "A tapered plant pot with a real drainage array in the floor, a matching drip saucer, and a hanging variant with three cord lugs. Sized by rim diameter and height with adjustable taper so pots nest for storage.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Una maceta cónica con una verdadera rejilla de drenaje en el fondo, un plato de goteo a juego y una variante colgante con tres orejetas para cordón. Se dimensiona por diámetro del borde y altura, con conicidad ajustable para que las macetas se apilen.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/plant-pot.webp",
    "difficulty": "beginner",
    "tags": ["plant", "pot", "planter", "saucer", "drainage", "garden", "hanging", "hyperobject", "commons"],
